0e8che sur m\u00e9tal, plexi, tetrapak) en relief (bois, lino, carton, gomme) et l\u2019impression \u00e0 plat (monotype, kitchen-litho, mokulitho) seront notre point de d\u00e9part pour l'exp\u00e9rimentation pendant toute l\u2019ann\u00e9e.\r\n\r\nMat\u00e9riel \u00e0 apporter: Tablier, carnet de croquis ou feuilles A4 papier machine, crayon, latte, cutter, gants (Latex), loques.Les mati\u00e8res premi\u00e8res (papier de gravure, lino, zinc, bois, plexi), peuvent \u00eatre achet\u00e9es sur place au prix co\u00fbtant.\r\n\r\nPar Ludmila Krasnova\r\n\r\nLocal Studio \r\nLes dimanches de 11h \u00e0 17h les 17\/9 ; 1\/10 ; 15\/10 ; 12\/11 ; 26\/11 ; 17\/12 ; 14\/1 ; 28\/1 ; 11\/12 ; 10\/3 ; 24\/3 ; 7\/4 ; 21\/4 ; 19\/5","performers":"Par Ludmila Krasnova","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":"secretariat.atl@woluwe1200.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559490"},"sp":{"name":"Gravure \/ Image imprim\u00e9e","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":"secretariat.atl@woluwe1200.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559490"},"nl":{"name":"Gravure \/ Image imprim\u00e9e","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","email":"secretariat.atl@woluwe1200.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 30","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.559490"}},"place":{"id":220532,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel Wolubilis","address_street_name":"Cours Paul-Henri Spaak","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"secretariat.atl@woluwe1200.be","website":"http:\/\/www.wolubilis.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 761 60 29","phone_booking":"+32 2 761 60 