rs\/agenda\/event-detail.50007485"},"pt":{"name":"Cypher Sex X Oddd","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007485"},"en":{"name":"Cypher Sex X Oddd","shortdescr":"To start this year, Constant celebrates the publication of the manual \"How to Cypher Sex: A Manual for Collective Digital Self-Defense Guides\" by the collective Cypher Sex. Constant happily invited Oddd to design this installation in the window.","longdescr":"To start this year, Constant celebrates the publication of the manual \"How to Cypher Sex: A Manual for Collective Digital Self-Defense Guides\". Constant supported the collective Cypher Sex in the making of this \"how to\" manual that will lay out strategies on how to write locally-oriented digital self-defense guides aimed at empowering LGBTQ* people, women, and sex workers. The manual is intended to help the writing of localised guides with basic outlines, resources, links, suggested approaches and interview questions relevant to different international locations that advocate self-empowerment through online identity management and other digital self-defence strategies. \n\nCypher Sex is a queer feminist collective aimed at empowering LGBTQ* people, women, and sex workers in their use of online services and digital tools through workshops, guides, and personalized consultancies. Constant happily invited Oddd to design this installation in the window.","performers":"Collectif Cypher Sex (artists); Oddd (graphic designer)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007485"},"it":{"name":"Cypher Sex X Oddd","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007485"},"cn":{"name":"Cypher Sex X Oddd","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007485"},"fr":{"name":"Cypher Sex X Oddd","shortdescr":"Pour commencer cette ann\u00e9e, Constant c\u00e9l\u00e8bre la publication du manuel  \"How to Cypher Sex : A Manual for Collective Digital Self-Defense Guides\". Constant par le collectif Cypher Sex.  Constant a joyeusement invit\u00e9 Oddd \u00e0 faire le design de cette installation en vitrine.","longdescr":"Pour commencer cette ann\u00e9e, Constant c\u00e9l\u00e8bre la publication du manuel  \"How to Cypher Sex : A Manual for Collective Digital Self-Defense Guides\". Constant a soutenu le collectif Cypher Sex dans la r\u00e9alisation de ce manuel qui propose des strat\u00e9gies pour r\u00e9diger des guides d\u2019autod\u00e9fense num\u00e9riques \u00e0 vocation locale visant \u00e0 empouvoirer les personnes LGBTQ*, des femmes et des travailleur\u00b7euse\u00b7s du sexe. Le manuel a pour but d\u2019aider \u00e0 la r\u00e9daction de guides localis\u00e9s avec des sch\u00e9mas de base, des ressources, des liens, des approches sugg\u00e9r\u00e9es et des questions d\u2019interview pertinentes pour diff\u00e9rents lieux internationaux qui pr\u00f4nent l\u2019autonomisation par la gestion de l\u2019identit\u00e9 en ligne et d\u2019autres strat\u00e9gies d\u2019autod\u00e9fense num\u00e9rique. \n\nCypher Sex est un collectif f\u00e9ministe queer dont l\u2019objectif est d\u2019aider les personnes LGBTQ*, les femmes et les travailleur\u00b7euse\u00b7s du sexe \u00e0 utiliser les services en ligne et les outils num\u00e9riques par le biais d\u2019ateliers, de guides et de services de conseil personnalis\u00e9s. Constant a joyeusement invit\u00e9 Oddd \u00e0 faire le design de cette installation en vitrine.","performers":"Collectif Cypher Sex (artistes); Oddd (graphiste)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007485"},"sp":{"name":"Cypher Sex X Oddd","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007485"},"nl":{"name":"Cypher Sex X Oddd","shortdescr":"Om dit jaar te openen viert Constant de publicatie van de handleiding \"How to Cypher Sex: A Manual for Collective Digital Self-Defense Guides\" door het collectief Cypher Sex. Constant nodigde Oddd graag uit om deze installatie in het raam te ontwerpen.","longdescr":"Om dit jaar te openen viert Constant de publicatie van de handleiding \"How to Cypher Sex: A Manual for Collective Digital Self-Defense Guides\". Constant steunde het collectief Cypher Sex bij het maken van deze \"how to\" handleiding waarin strategie\u00ebn worden uitgelegd voor het schrijven van lokaal geori\u00ebnteerde digitale zelfverdedigingsgidsen gericht op het ondersteunen van LGBTQ* mensen, vrouwen en sekswerkers. De handleiding is bedoeld om te helpen bij het schrijven van gelokaliseerde gidsen met basisoverzichten, bronnen, links, voorgestelde benaderingen en interviewvragen die relevant zijn voor verschillende internationale locaties die pleiten voor zelfversterking door online identiteitsbeheer en andere digitale zelfverdedigingsstrategie\u00ebn. \n\nCypher Sex is een queer feministisch collectief dat zich richt op het versterken van LGBTQ*-personen, vrouwen en sekswerkers in hun gebruik van online diensten en digitale hulpmiddelen door middel van workshops, gidsen en persoonlijke consultancies. Constant nodigde Oddd graag uit om deze installatie in het raam te ontwerpen.","performers":"Collectif Cypher Sex (kunstenaressen); Oddd (grafisch ontwerper)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/constantvzw.org","email":"info@constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007485"}},"place":{"id":243917,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Constant asbl","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Constant","address_street_name":"Rue du Fort","address_street_number":"5","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@constantvzw.org","website":"http:\/\/www.constantvzw.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 539 24 67","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue du Fort, 5","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"descriptio