:"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"ART NOUVEAU, art for all ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/hallessaintgery.be\/","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 44 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004885"},"pt":{"name":"ART NOUVEAU, art for all ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/hallessaintgery.be\/","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 44 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004885"},"en":{"name":"ART NOUVEAU, art for all ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"The exhibition \u201cART NOUVEAU, art for all ?\u201d, presented at the end of the Art Nouveau Year programme, invites visitors to reappropriate objects and subjects from Brussels Art Nouveau house museums.\n\nThrough a participatory and multidisciplinary experience, the project establishes a dialogue between contemporary social issues and opens up new narrative perspectives. Exhibited in a Fascinations Showroom, various exploration paths invite visitors to become captivated by and to reflect on Art Nouveau. The ambivalence of this movement, presented in the form of fascinating stands, leads to many subjective interpretations. The exhibition questions the challenges of the post-museum era by creating a space where visitors can express themselves, touch and hear several voices.\n\nThe Art Nouveau Brussels 2023 programme is run jointly by urban.brussels and visit.brussels.\n","performers":"This project brings together a hybrid group of researchers, associations, artists and citizens. The exhibition in this laboratory discusses new perspectives and reinterprets the current slogan \u201cArt Nouveau, art for all\u201d.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/hallessaintgery.be\/","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 44 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004885"},"it":{"name":"ART NOUVEAU, art for all ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/hallessaintgery.be\/","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 44 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004885"},"cn":{"name":"ART NOUVEAU, art for all ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/hallessaintgery.be\/","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 44 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004885"},"fr":{"name":"ART NOUVEAU, un art pour tous\u00b7tes ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Pr\u00e9sent\u00e9e en fin de programmation de l\u2019ann\u00e9e Art Nouveau, l\u2019exposition \u201cART NOUVEAU, un art pour tous\u00b7tes ?\u201d invite \u00e0 se r\u00e9approprier les objets et sujets des maisons mus\u00e9es de l\u2019Art Nouveau bruxellois. \nPar le biais d\u2019une exp\u00e9rience participative et pluridisciplinaire, le projet fait dialoguer des enjeux sociaux contemporains et ouvre de nouvelles perspectives narratives. Expos\u00e9s au sein d\u2019un Salon des Fascinations, divers chemins d\u2019explorations invitent \u00e0 se captiver et s\u2019interroger sur l\u2019Art Nouveau. Les ambivalences de ce mouvement, pr\u00e9sent\u00e9es sous forme de stands fascinants, m\u00e8nent \u00e0 des interpr\u00e9tations multiples et subjectives. L'exposition questionne les d\u00e9fis du post-mus\u00e9e par la cr\u00e9ation d\u2019un espace o\u00f9 les visiteur.euse.s peuvent s'exprimer, toucher et entendre des voix multiples. \n\nLe programme Art Nouveau Bruxelles 2023 est port\u00e9 conjointement par urban.brussels et visit.brussels. ","performers":"Ce projet r\u00e9unit un groupe hybride compos\u00e9 de chercheur.euse.s, d'associations, d'artistes et de citoyen.ne.s. L\u2019exposition de ce laboratoire raconte des nouveaux regards et r\u00e9interpr\u00e8te le slogan de l\u2019\u00e9poque \u201cl\u2019Art nouveau, un art pour tous\u201d. ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/hallessaintgery.be\/","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 44 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004885"},"sp":{"name":"ART NOUVEAU, art for all ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/hallessaintgery.be\/","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 44 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004885"},"nl":{"name":"ART NOUVEAU, kunst voor iedereen ?","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"We blikken vooruit naar de tentoonstelling  \u201cART NOUVEAU, kunst voor iedereen ?\u201d, die op het einde van het Jaar van de art nouveau geprogrammeerd staat en ons uitnodigt ons te verdiepen in de voorwerpen en onderwerpen van Brusselse art-nouveauhuizen\/-musea.\nVia een participatieve en multidisciplinaire benadering legt het project de link met hedendaagse maatschappelijke uitdagingen en wordt er ruimte vrijmaakt voor nieuwe vertelperspectieven. In een \u201csalon des Fascinations\u201d zetten verschillende ontdekkingstrajecten de bezoekers niet alleen aan zich volledig in de art nouveau onder te dompelen, maar worden zij ook gestimuleerd om deze stroming in vraag te stellen. De ambivalentie van de beweging wordt op een fascinerende wijze voorgesteld en leidt tot meervoudige en subjectieve interpretaties. De tentoonstelling stelt de uitdagingen van het postmuseale aspect in vraag en voorziet dan ook in een ruimte waar de bezoekers de kans krijgen hun mening uit te drukken, naar andere opinies te luisteren en zich door andere denkbeelden te laten raken. \n\nHet programma Art Nouveau Brussel wordt samen gedragen door urban.brussels en visit.brussels. ","performers":"Het project brengt een hybride groep samen en bestaat uit onderzoekers, verenigingen, kunstenaars en burgers. De tentoonstelling van dit experiment vertelt het verhaal vanuit nieuwe standpunten met als doel de slogan \u201cart nouveau, kunst voor iedereen\u201d. ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/hallessaintgery.be\/","email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":"+32 2 502 44 24","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50004885"}},"place":{"id":247371,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry mit ihrer eklektischen Architektur wurden Ende des 19. Jahrhundert als Markthalle erbaut und spielten in der Br\u00fcsseler Stadtgeschichte eine wichtige Rolle.\r\n\r\nDie Saint-G\u00e9ry-Hallen waren einerseits sowohl legend\u00e4re als auch kaufm\u00e4nnische Wiege der Stadt. Ab dem 11. Jahrhundert stand an dieser Stelle eine dem Heiligen Saint-G\u00e9ry gewidmete Kapelle. Verschiedene Wohnh\u00e4user waren hier entstanden und aufgrund der N\u00e4he zur Senne entwickelten sich zahlreiche Aktivit\u00e4ten.\r\n\r\nIm 16. Jahrhundert erhielt die Kapelle den Status einer Pfarrkirche, die prachtvoll im gotischen Stil erweitert wurde, dann aber im Zuge der Franz\u00f6sische Revolution dem Erdboden gleichgemacht wurde.\r\n\r\nDer ehemalige Markt - und sogar das gesamte Saint-G\u00e9ry-Viertel \u2013 waren ihrerseits in den 1960er-Jahren von der Zerst\u00f6rung bedroht, bis das Viertel in den 1990er-Jahren eine Art zweiten Fr\u00fchling erlebte. Seit 1999 fungieren die Saint-G\u00e9ry-Hallen als Informations- und Ausstellungszentrum rund um die Br\u00fcsseler Stadtgeschichte und das st\u00e4dtische Leben in Br\u00fcssel. An der Bar gibt es Getr\u00e4nke und Speisen.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Saint-G\u00e9ry Market Halls are a fine architectural example of 19th-century public markets in Brussels. The building was completely restored several years ago and is now a permanent information and exhibition space, with urban planning, heritage, and urban renewal as its central themes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Halle di Saint-Gery","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry (mercato coperto) ospitano un centro d'informazione dedicato al patrimonio e al quadro di vita dei Bruxellesi...\r\nLe Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry (mercato coperto) ospitano un centro d'informazione dedicato al patrimonio e al quadro di vita dei Bruxellesi. Sotto il patrocinio della regione di Bruxelles Capitale.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Remarquable t\u00e9moin de l\u2019architecture des march\u00e9s couverts, les Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry  contribuent \u00e0 valoriser le patrimoine de la R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale. Centre d\u2019exposition et de manifestation bas\u00e9 en plein coeur du pentagone, elles ont pour vocation de mettre en valeur les traits de d\u00e9marcation du cadre de vie bruxellois et de son identit\u00e9 urbaine par le biais d'une programmation hybride, allant des expositions, aux conf\u00e9rences, concerts, rencontres et performances \u2026\r\nLe Centre Urbain (guichet d\u2019information r\u00e9gional, pour mieux vous conseiller sur l\u2019habitat durable en R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale) est \u00e9galement situ\u00e9 au sein des Halles.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Verdadero testigo de los mercados cubiertos, las Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry albergan un centro de informaci\u00f3n, bajo la \u00e9gida de la Regio\u00f3n de Bruselas Capital y dedicado al patrimonio...\r\nVerdadero testigo de los mercados cubiertos, las Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry albergan un centro de informaci\u00f3n, bajo la \u00e9gida de la Regio\u00f3n de Bruselas Capital y dedicado al patrimonio y al marco de vida de los bruselenses.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Sint-Gorikshallen","address_street_name":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De Sint-Gorikshallen zijn een prachtig architecturaal staaltje van openbare markthallen in het 19de-eeuwse Brussel. Het gebouw werd een aantal jaren geleden volledig gerestaureerd en doet tegenwoordig dienst als permanente informatie-, tentoonstellings- en evenementenruimte gewijd aan het erfgoed en de levenswijzen in de hoofdstad. Op amper twee minuten stappen van de Beurs vormen de Sint-Gorikshallen een gezellige plek om te ontspannen en nieuwe dingen te ontdekken, zowel overdag als bij het vallen van de nacht.\r\nDe hallen herbergen ook de Stadswinkel, een vereniging die de inwoners van het Brussels Hoofdstedelijk Gewest  wil informeren over het leefmilieu en een kwaliteitsvolle leefomgeving, huisvesting, stadsrenovatie, stedenbouw en ruimtelijke ordening, en rationeel energiegebruik. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"de":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"pt":[null],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"it":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"sp":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":9562,"location":{"lat":50.84801328,"lon":4.34683241},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-12-19T14:03:38+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:26:22+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":247371,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry mit ihrer eklektischen Architektur wurden Ende des 19. Jahrhundert als Markthalle erbaut und spielten in der Br\u00fcsseler Stadtgeschichte eine wichtige Rolle.\r\n\r\nDie Saint-G\u00e9ry-Hallen waren einerseits sowohl legend\u00e4re als auch kaufm\u00e4nnische Wiege der Stadt. Ab dem 11. Jahrhundert stand an dieser Stelle eine dem Heiligen Saint-G\u00e9ry gewidmete Kapelle. Verschiedene Wohnh\u00e4user waren hier entstanden und aufgrund der N\u00e4he zur Senne entwickelten sich zahlreiche Aktivit\u00e4ten.\r\n\r\nIm 16. Jahrhundert erhielt die Kapelle den Status einer Pfarrkirche, die prachtvoll im gotischen Stil erweitert wurde, dann aber im Zuge der Franz\u00f6sische Revolution dem Erdboden gleichgemacht wurde.\r\n\r\nDer ehemalige Markt - und sogar das gesamte Saint-G\u00e9ry-Viertel \u2013 waren ihrerseits in den 1960er-Jahren von der Zerst\u00f6rung bedroht, bis das Viertel in den 1990er-Jahren eine Art zweiten Fr\u00fchling erlebte. Seit 1999 fungieren die Saint-G\u00e9ry-Hallen als Informations- und Ausstellungszentrum rund um die Br\u00fcsseler Stadtgeschichte und das st\u00e4dtische Leben in Br\u00fcssel. An der Bar gibt es Getr\u00e4nke und Speisen.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Saint-G\u00e9ry Market Halls are a fine architectural example of 19th-century public markets in Brussels. The building was completely restored several years ago and is now a permanent information and exhibition space, with urban planning, heritage, and urban renewal as its central themes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Halle di Saint-Gery","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry (mercato coperto) ospitano un centro d'informazione dedicato al patrimonio e al quadro di vita dei Bruxellesi...\r\nLe Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry (mercato coperto) ospitano un centro d'informazione dedicato al patrimonio e al quadro di vita dei Bruxellesi. Sotto il patrocinio della regione di Bruxelles Capitale.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@hallessaintgery.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallessaintgery.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 44 24","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visi