null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-love-baroque?id_evenement=5799","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007001"},"pt":{"name":"Love Baroque by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-love-baroque?id_evenement=5799","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007001"},"en":{"name":"Love Baroque by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":"You were delighted by last season's Baroque concert.\nSo we have no choice but to present a new Baroque concert, performed by the same ensemble, with two other singers!\nSo Love Bach !\n-\nProgram :\nJ.S. Bach \/ Cl. Monteverdi \/ G.W.Haendel \/ A. Vivaldi\nconcerto for harpsichord BVW 1052 \/ Erbarme Dich \/ Lascia Che Piango \/ Pur Ti Miro \/\nParting Souls \/ Nulla In Mundo Pax \/...","longdescr":"Many of you were delighted with last season's Baroque concert, Amor XXX, on February 12, 2023.\nSo we had no choice but to present another Baroque concert, performed by the same ensemble, with two other singers!\n-\nOnce again, a concert from the \"greatest hits\" collection, in this case by Johann Sebastian Bach. At the confluence of sadness and grandeur, we present Bach's famous (and perhaps best!) Keyboard Concerto.\nLove Bach all the way, and for the occasion, don't come alone.\n-\nMusicians :\nGuillaume Houcke counter-tenor\nWei-Lian Huang soprano\nOlivia Afendulis harpsichord\nEnsemble Iris (quintet)\n-\nProgram :\nJ.S. Bach \/ Cl. Monteverdi \/ G.W.Haendel \/ A. Vivaldi\nharpsichord concerto BVW 1052 \/ Erbarme Dich \/ Lascia Che Piango \/ Pur Ti Miro \/ Parting Souls \/ Nulla In Mundo Pax \/...\n\n","performers":"Guillaume Houcke (contra-tenor) - Wei-Lian Huang (soprano) - Olivia Afendulis (harpsichord) -\nIris Ensemble (string quintet with harpsichord)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-love-baroque?id_evenement=5799","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007001"},"it":{"name":"Love Baroque by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-love-baroque?id_evenement=5799","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007001"},"cn":{"name":"Love Baroque by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-love-baroque?id_evenement=5799","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007001"},"fr":{"name":"Love Baroque by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":"Vous avez \u00e9t\u00e9 conquis\u00b7es par le concert baroque de la saison derni\u00e8re.\nDonc pas d\u2019autre choix que de vous pr\u00e9senter un autre concert baroque, interpr\u00e9t\u00e9 par le m\u00eame ensemble, avec deux autres chanteur\u00b7ses !\n-\nProgramme :\nJ.S. Bach \/ Cl. Monteverdi \/ G.W.Haendel \/ A. Vivaldi\nconcerto pour clavecin BVW 1052 \/ Erbarme Dich \/ Lascia Che Piango \/ Pur Ti Miro \/\nParting Souls \/ Nulla In Mundo Pax \/...\n","longdescr":"Vous avez \u00e9t\u00e9 nombreux et conquis.es par le concert baroque de la saison derni\u00e8re, Amor XXX, le 12 f\u00e9vrier 2023.\n-\nNous n'avons donc pas eu d'autre choix que de vous pr\u00e9senter un autre concert baroque, interpr\u00e9t\u00e9 par le m\u00eame ensemble, avec deux autres chanteur.ses !\n-\nUne fois de plus, un concert dans la collection des \"grands succ\u00e8s\", en l'occurrence de Jean-S\u00e9bastien Bach. Au confluent de la tristesse et de la grandeur, nous pr\u00e9sentons le c\u00e9l\u00e8bre (et peut-\u00eatre le meilleur !) Concerto pour clavier de Bach.\nLove Bach total, donc, et pour l'occasion, ne venez pas seul.\n-\nMusicien.ne.s :\nGuillaume Houcke contre-t\u00e9nor\nWei-Lian Huang soprano\nOlivia Afendulis clavecin\nEnsemble Iris (quintet)\n-\nProgramme :\nJ.S. Bach \/ Cl. Monteverdi \/ G.W.Haendel \/ A. Vivaldi\nconcerto pour clavecin BVW 1052 \/ Erbarme Dich \/ Lascia Che Piango \/ Pur Ti Miro \/\nParting Souls \/ Nulla In Mundo Pax \/...\n","performers":"Guillaume Houcke (contra-tenor) - Wei-Lian Huang (soprano) - Olivia Afendulis (harpsichord) -\nIris Ensemble (quintet \u00e0 cordes avec clavecin)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-love-baroque?id_evenement=5799","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007001"},"sp":{"name":"Love Baroque by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-love-baroque?id_evenement=5799","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007001"},"nl":{"name":"Love Baroque by Concerts Escapades","shortdescr":"Jullie waren enthousiast over het barokconcert van vorig seizoen.\nDus kunnen we niet anders dan een nieuw barokconcert presenteren, uitgevoerd door hetzelfde ensemble, met twee andere zangers!\nSo Love Bach !\n-\nProgramma :\nJ.S. Bach \/ Cl. Monteverdi \/ G.W.Haendel \/ A. Vivaldi\nconcerto voor klavecimbel BVW 1052 \/ Erbarme Dich \/ Lascia Che Piango \/ Pur Ti Miro \/\nParting Souls \/ Nulla In Mundo Pax \/..","longdescr":"Er zijn rechten en plichten. \nNa het buitengewone barokconcert van vorig seizoen was het onze plicht om u opnieuw een barokconcert te presenteren. \n-\nHet is uw recht om opnieuw hetzelfde ensemble te horen dat u vorig jaar in verrukking bracht. \nDit jaar met 2 nieuwe zangers. \n-\nOpnieuw een verzameling 'greatest hits', grenzend aan droefheid en afgewisseld met grandeur: het bekende klavierconcert, waarschijnlijk Bachs beste. \nSo Love Bach, die altijd alles goed doet!\n-\nMuzikanten :\nGuillaume Houcke (countertenor)\nWei-Lian Huang (sopraan)\nOlivia Afendulis (klavecimbel)\nEnsemble Iris (quintet)\n-\nProgramma :\nJ.S. Bach \/ Cl. Monteverdi \/ G.W.Haendel \/ A. Vivaldi\nconcerto voor klavecimbel BVW 1052 \/ Erbarme Dich \/ Lascia Che Piango \/ Pur Ti Miro \/ Parting Souls \/ Nulla In Mundo Pax \/...\n ","performers":"Guillaume Houcke (contra-tenor) - Wei-Lian Huang (sopraan) - Olivia Afendulis (klavecimbel) - Iris Ensemble (strijkkwintet met klavecimbel).\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/escapades-love-baroque?id_evenement=5799","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007001"}},"place":{"id":252101,"translations":{"de":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Link factory","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie is above all a civil, cultural, sustainable and innovative project. Their cultural programme featuring performances, shows, exhibitions and so on goes hand in hand with a \u201ccivil\u201d programme of debates, conferences, inter-generational workshops, philosophical caf\u00e9 etc ... The place can be rented for events and there are plenty of really great parties! ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie est un projet culturel fond\u00e9 en 2010 par une poign\u00e9e de citoyen\u00b7nes et situ\u00e9 dans une ancienne usine restaur\u00e9e avec des mat\u00e9riaux \u00e9cologiques. La Tricoterie propose une programmation culturelle tr\u00e8s diversifi\u00e9e et centr\u00e9e sur la rencontre entre les diff\u00e9rents publics et le m\u00e9lange des activit\u00e9s culturelles.\r\n\r\nPassez la porte et d\u00e9couvrez :\r\n- Des spectacles de th\u00e9\u00e2tre, de danse, de cirque...\r\n- Des concerts, des soir\u00e9es, des sc\u00e8nes ouvertes, des jam sessions, une chorale d'un soir...\r\n- Des ateliers z\u00e9ro d\u00e9chet, peinture, c\u00e9ramique, \u0153nologie, danse...\r\n- Des projections de films, conf\u00e9rences, d\u00e9bats...\r\n- Des couscous \"s\u00e9pharabes\", des soir\u00e9es jeux de soci\u00e9t\u00e9, des activit\u00e9s pour enfants...\r\n- Des march\u00e9s des cr\u00e9ateur\u00b7rices, des vide-dressings, des march\u00e9s de No\u00ebl durables...\r\n\r\nUn petit creux ? La Triciterie vous propose un brunch tous les dimanches et un concept \"live cooking\" tous les vendredis soirs. Tous les plats sont 100% artisanaux, et pr\u00e9par\u00e9s sur place par l'\u00e9quipe avec des ingr\u00e9dients bio, locaux et de saison.\r\n\r\nEnvie d'organiser votre \u00e9v\u00e9nement chez vous ? La Tricoterie met ses salles \u00e0 disposition pour tout type d'\u00e9v\u00e9nement priv\u00e9 ou professionnel et propose \u00e9galement un service traiteur, que ce soit dans ses murs ou \u00e0 l'ext\u00e9rieur. Rendez-vous sur www.tricoterie.be pour en savoir plus !\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Contactenfabriek","address_street_name":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat, 158","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"La Tricoterie is een project met een welomlijnde filosofie, die blijkt uit de zelfgekozen naam (van tricoter, breien) waarmee verwijst wordt naar het smeden van banden om de strijd tegen de ontrafeling van het sociale weefsel aan te gaan. Opgezet als een \u00abContacten Fabriek\u00bb en een ontmoetingsplaats waar verschillende disciplines en publieken elkaar ontmoeten. Naast een culturele programmering (concerten, voorstellingen, expos\u2026) en socioculturele activiteiten die sociale cohesie beogen (debatten, conferenties, intergenerationele ateliers, caf\u00e9-filo\u2026) staan de ruimtes ook open voor verhuur aan externe organisaties en bedrijven. Tal van superleuke feestjes vinden er plaats, alsook een wekelijkse biomarkt, een repaircaf\u00e9 en een alternatieve geschenkenmarkt om maar enkele van de activiteiten te noemen die de duurzame levensvisie van de plek weerspiegelen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[7],"translations":{"de":["Saint-Gilles Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"it":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"sp":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"nl":["Sint-Gillis centrum"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":14176,"location":{"lat":50.83028735,"lon":4.33675871},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-01-25T14:21:07+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:47:56+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":276119,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Music Projects for Brussels ","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Music Projects for Brussels ","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":nu