che von Ausstellungen"],"pt":[null],"en":["Exhibition guided tours"],"it":["Visite a esposizioni"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Visites d'expositions"],"sp":["Visitas a las exposiciones"],"nl":["Tentoonstelling"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e en langue des signes (LSFB)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/05\/11\/visite-guidee-en-langue-des-signes-lsfb-13","email":"myriam.dom@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)498 77 55 72","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007007"},"pt":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e en langue des signes (LSFB)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/05\/11\/visite-guidee-en-langue-des-signes-lsfb-13","email":"myriam.dom@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)498 77 55 72","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007007"},"en":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e en langue des signes (LSFB)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/05\/11\/visite-guidee-en-langue-des-signes-lsfb-13","email":"myriam.dom@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)498 77 55 72","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007007"},"it":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e en langue des signes (LSFB)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/05\/11\/visite-guidee-en-langue-des-signes-lsfb-13","email":"myriam.dom@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)498 77 55 72","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007007"},"cn":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e en langue des signes (LSFB)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/05\/11\/visite-guidee-en-langue-des-signes-lsfb-13","email":"myriam.dom@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)498 77 55 72","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007007"},"fr":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e en langue des signes (LSFB)","shortdescr":"En compagnie d\u2019une guide sourde, form\u00e9e au Mus\u00e9e, d\u00e9couvrez les dialogues po\u00e9tiques et les \u00abaffinit\u00e9s \u00e9lectives\u00bb qui rapprochent Magritte et Folon.","longdescr":"En 2024, Bruxelles c\u00e9l\u00e8bre les 100 ans du surr\u00e9alisme. \u00c0 cette occasion, le Mus\u00e9e Magritte imagine un dialogue entre l'univers fascinant de Ren\u00e9 Magritte (1898-1967) et les cr\u00e9ations po\u00e9tiques de Jean-Michel Folon (1934-2005). Magritte\u00b7Folon est plus qu\u2019une exposition : une rencontre sous le signe du r\u00eave et un dialogue entre deux imaginaires particuliers.\n\nMagritte ouvre les chemins du myst\u00e8re en peinture, tandis que Folon, \u00e0 sa suite, explore \u00e9galement les voies de la po\u00e9sie.\n\nCette exposition, tenue au sein m\u00eame du Mus\u00e9e Magritte, met en r\u00e9sonance les \u0153uvres de ces deux artistes belges majeurs, leurs liens et leurs langages.\n\nUne exposition du Mus\u00e9e Magritte en partenariat avec la\u202fFondation Folon.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/05\/11\/visite-guidee-en-langue-des-signes-lsfb-13","email":"myriam.dom@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)498 77 55 72","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007007"},"sp":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e en langue des signes (LSFB)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/05\/11\/visite-guidee-en-langue-des-signes-lsfb-13","email":"myriam.dom@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)498 77 55 72","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007007"},"nl":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e en langue des signes (LSFB)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/05\/11\/visite-guidee-en-langue-des-signes-lsfb-13","email":"myriam.dom@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)498 77 55 72","phone_booking":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 51","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50007007"}},"place":{"id":246650,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 508 33 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":"22\/06\/2022\r\nDas Magritte-Museum begeistert auf 2500 m\u00b2 Ausstellungsfl\u00e4che mit der umfangreichsten Magritte-Sammlung der Welt: Zu sehen gibt es mehr als 200 Werke des ber\u00fchmten belgischen Surrealisten Ren\u00e9 Magritte, darunter \u00d6lgem\u00e4lde, Zeichnungen, Skulpturen und bemalte Objekte ebenso wie Werbeplakate, Musikpartituren, Fotos und Filme von Magritte selbst.\r\n\r\nDie gro\u00dfen Meisterwerke Magrittes: Die ausgestellten Arbeiten, darunter die gro\u00dfen Meisterwerke des K\u00fcnstlers, wie \u201eDie Herrschaft des Lichts\" (L\u2019Empire de Lumi\u00e8res), \u201eDie R\u00fcckkehr\" (Le Retour), \u201eDie Suche nach der Wahrheit\" (La Recherche de la v\u00e9rit\u00e9), \u201eHimmelsvogel\" (L\u2019Oiseau de Ciel) und \u201eDie Domaine von Arnheim\" (Le Domaine d\u2019Arnheim) sind hier versammelt. Sie stammen gr\u00f6\u00dftenteils aus Verm\u00e4chtnissen und Neuerwerbungen des Museums der Sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnste, die durch private Leihgaben erg\u00e4nzt wurden. Das Magritte-Museum gew\u00e4hrt einen tiefen Einblick in das k\u00fcnstlerische Werk Magrittes und genie\u00dft eine weltweite Anerkennung.\r\n\r\nBr\u00fcsseler Museumsattraktion: Das Museum, das sich im H\u00f4tel Althenloh - einem Teil der K\u00f6niglichen Museen der Sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnste - befindet, erweist sich als echter Publikumsmagnet - in weniger als einem Jahr empfing es mehr als 500 000 Besucher.\r\n\r\nDas Magritte-Museum ist ganz sicher eine der kulturellen Attraktionen Br\u00fcssels. Nicht umsonst erhielt es 2012 den Publikumspreis als bestes Br\u00fcsseler Museum!","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 508 33 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":"22\/06\/2022\r\nO Museu Magritte abriu as suas portas no dia 2 de junho de 2009 num edif\u00edcio de 2500 m\u00b2 da propriedade dos Museus Reais das Belas Artes da B\u00e9lgica.\r\nMultidisciplinar, esta cole\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 a mais rica do mundo e comporta mais de 200 obras compostas de \u00f3leos em tela, guaches, desenhos, esculturas e objetos pintados, mas tamb\u00e9m de cartazes publicit\u00e1rios, partituras musicais, fotos vintage e filmes realizados pelo pr\u00f3prio Magritte.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum","address_street_name":"Koningsplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 508 33 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Koningsplein","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum, located in the heart of Brussels, brings together the world's largest collection of the renowned surrealist artist Ren\u00e9 Magritte: 230 works and archives are displayed. The multidisciplinary space houses paintings, gouaches, drawings, sculptures, and painted objects, as well as advertising posters, musical scores, photographs and films. The Museum also has the most important collection from the artist\u2019s \"vache\" period.\r\nThe selection of works exhibited in the Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium is constantly expanding with a changing selection of external loans. With the support of Belgian and foreign museums as well as private collectors, works are being made available that have previously never been exhibited. The visitor can thus discover many treasures that are still in private possession.\r\nThe Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum has already received 8 nominations and prizes. Every year more than 300,000 visitors come here for all over the world to discover the life and the works of Ren\u00e9 Magritte.\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 508 33 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Situato nel cuore di Bruxelles, il Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum ospita la pi\u00f9 grande collezione al mondo di opere del grande artista belga, con un\u2019esposizione di 230 opere e archivi. Lo spazio multidisciplinare riunisce dipinti, gouache, disegni, sculture, oggetti dipinti, oltre a manifesti pubblicitari, spartiti musicali, fotografie e film. Il Museo ospita inoltre la pi\u00f9 importante collezione di opere del periodo \"vache\" (vacche) dell'artista.\nIl Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum vanta un allestimento dinamico: le opere in mostra nei 2.500 m\u00b2 di spazio espositivo cambiano regolarmente, grazie alla fiducia di collezionisti privati e istituzioni pubbliche che acconsentono a prestiti di opere a lungo termine. La ricchezza delle collezioni dei Mus\u00e9es royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique permette di creare innumerevoli dialoghi anche con altri artisti.\nIl Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum ha gi\u00e0 ottenuto otto nomination e riconoscimenti. Ogni anno, oltre 300.000 visitatori provenienti da tutto il mondo vengono a conoscere la vita e l'opera di Ren\u00e9 Magritte.","description_print":"22\/06\/2022\r\nIl Museo Magritte di Bruxelles ospita la pi\u00f9 ampia collezione al mondo di opere di Ren\u00e9 Magritte, il celebre pittore surrealista.\r\n\r\nAperto il 2 giugno 2009, ospitato nell'Hotel Althenloh un edificio appartenente ai Musei Reali delle Belle Arti, il museo \u00e8 un centro di riferimento mondiale per lo studio e la conoscenza dell'artista.\r\n\r\nLe opere esposte, tra cui i pi\u00f9 grandi capolavori del pittore, provengono principalmente da lasciti, da acquisti dei Musei reali delle Belle Arti e da prestiti privati.\r\n\r\nLa collezione conta pi\u00f9 di 200 opere tra cui oli su tela, gouache, sculture e di oggetti dipinti ma anche manifesti pubblicitari, spartiti musicali, foto e film realizzati dallo stesso Magritte, maestro del surrealismo.\r\n","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 508 33 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 508 33 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum, situ\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, rassemble la plus importante collection au monde de l\u2019incontournable artiste belge, Ren\u00e9 Magritte : 230 \u0153uvres et archives y sont pr\u00e9sent\u00e9es. L\u2019espace multidisciplinaire r\u00e9unit \u00e0 la fois des tableaux, des gouaches, des dessins, des sculptures, des objets peints, mais aussi des affiches publicitaires, des partitions de musique, des photographies et des films. Le Mus\u00e9e contient \u00e9galement la collection la plus importante de la p\u00e9riode \u00ab vache \u00bb de l\u2019artiste.\r\nL'accrochage du Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum est con\u00e7u de mani\u00e8re dynamique : les \u0153uvres expos\u00e9es dans les 2.500 m\u00b2 du lieu changent r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la confiance des collectionneurs priv\u00e9s et des institutions publiques qui pr\u00eatent des \u0153uvres \u00e0 long terme au Mus\u00e9e. La richesse des collections des Mus\u00e9es royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique permet de cr\u00e9er de nombreux dialogues avec d'autres artistes.\r\nLe Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum a d\u00e9j\u00e0 remport\u00e9 huit nominations et r\u00e9compenses. Chaque ann\u00e9e, plus de 300.000 visiteurs venus du monde entier y d\u00e9couvrent la vie et l'\u0153uvre de Ren\u00e9 Magritte.\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo Magritte","address_street_name":"Place Royale","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 508 33 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Royale","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"El Museo Magritte, situado en el coraz\u00f3n de Bruselas, alberga la mayor colecci\u00f3n del mundo de obras del gran artista belga Ren\u00e9 Magritte: se exponen 230 obras y archivos. El espacio multidisciplinar re\u00fane pinturas, aguadas, dibujos, esculturas y objetos pintados, as\u00ed como carteles publicitarios, partituras musicales, fotograf\u00edas y pel\u00edculas. El museo tambi\u00e9n alberga la colecci\u00f3n m\u00e1s importante del periodo \"\u00abvache\u00bb del artista.\nEl Museo Magritte est\u00e1 concebido para ser din\u00e1mico: las obras expuestas en los 2.500 m\u00b2 de exposici\u00f3n cambian peri\u00f3dicamente gracias a la confianza de coleccionistas privados e instituciones p\u00fablicas que prestan obras al museo a largo plazo. La riqueza de las colecciones de los Reales Museos de Bellas Artes de B\u00e9lgica permite crear numerosos di\u00e1logos con otros artistas.\nEl Museo Magritte ha obtenido ya ocho nominaciones y premios. Cada a\u00f1o, m\u00e1s de 300.000 visitantes de todo el mundo descubren la vida y obra de Ren\u00e9 Magritte.","description_print":"22\/06\/2022\r\nUbicado en la Place Royale de Bruselas, el Museo Magritte Museum presenta las obras del pintor belga Ren\u00e9 Magritte, un artista prol\u00edfico y maestro del surrealismo.\r\n\r\nEn el barrio de los museos de Bruselas, te esperan m\u00e1s de 200 obras del pintor surrealista belga Ren\u00e9 Magritte, en el Hotel Altenloh, un antiguo edificio neocl\u00e1sico que data de finales del s. XVIII.\r\n\r\nLa excepcional colecci\u00f3n del museo est\u00e1 compuesta de \u00f3leos, gouaches, dibujos, esculturas y objetos pintados, pero tambi\u00e9n carteles publicitarios, partituras de m\u00fasica, fotograf\u00edas Vintage y pel\u00edculas realizadas por el propio Magritte.\r\n\r\nLas obras presentadas, como la del Imperio de las Luces, provienen principalmente de legados y compras de los Museos Reales de Bellas Artes de B\u00e9lgica, completados por pr\u00e9stamos privados.\r\n","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum","address_street_name":"Koningsplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 508 33 33","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Koningsplein","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Het Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum, in het hart van Brussel, is met zijn meer dan 230 werken en archiefstukken de belangrijkste verzameling ter wereld van de Belgische kunstenaar Ren\u00e9 Magritte. De multidisplinaire opstelling toont zijn schilderijen, \r\ngouaches, tekeningen, beelden, beschilderde objecten, maar ook zijn publicitaire affiches, muziekpartituren, foto\u2019s en films. Het Museum beschikt eveneens over de belangrijkste collectie werken uit zijn \"vache\"-periode.\r\n\r\nDe tentoongestelde selectie werken uit de Koninklijke Musea voor Schone Kunsten van Belgi\u00eb wordt steeds uitgebreid met een wisselende presentatie van externe bruiklenen. Belgische en buitenlandse musea en priv\u00e9verzamelaars steunen dit museumproject en stellen hun vaak nog nooit eerder getoonde werken ter beschikking. De bezoeker kan daardoor tal van juweeltjes ontdekken die nog steeds in priv\u00e9bezit zijn.\r\nHet Mus\u00e9e Magritte Museum sleepte reeds 8 nominaties en prijzen in de wacht. Jaarlijks komen meer dan 300.000 bezoekers over de vloer, die genieten van 2.500 m\u00b2 expositieruimte.\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[16],"translations":{"de":["K\u00f6nigliches Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["Royal"],"it":["Quartiere reale"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Quartier Royal"],"sp":["Quartier Royal \u2014Barrio de la Corte\u2014"],"nl":["Koninklijke wijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":8873,"location":{"lat":50.8424508,"lon":4.3592446},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-03-15T11:46:36+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:24:53+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":488,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique \u2013 6 Museen, 7 Jahrhunderte der sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnste, 20 000 Kunstwerke und Kunstgenuss vom Feinsten:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Magritte gibt es die weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dfte Sammlung von Werken des gro\u00dfen belgischen Surrealisten Ren\u00e9 Magritte zu entdecken\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle erwartet den Besucher mit K\u00fcnstlern wie Khnopff, Spilliaert, Horta, Rodin, Gauguin, Mucha und Bonnard das besondere Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle-Ambiente, das um 1900 in Br\u00fcssel herrschte. Mehr als 30 K\u00fcnstler \u2013 vom Impressionismus \u00fcber den Jugendstil, von den sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnsten bis zur Oper.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Old Master gibt es Meisterwerke aus der Epoche des 15. Jahrhunderts bis hin zum 18. Jahrhundert zu sehen, unter anderem mit der weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dften Bruegel-Sammlung, verschiedenen Werken von Rubens, van der Weyden und Jordaens. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tDas Mus\u00e9e Modern Art zeigt eine Auswahl von Meisterwerken des 20. Jahrhunderts, darunter Broodthaers, Fabre, David, Panamarenko, Alechinsky.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tDie beiden Kunstatelier-Museen Mus\u00e9e Wiertz und Meunier in Ixelles geben einen faszinierenden Einblick in die Welt dieser beiden K\u00fcnstler.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium","address_street_name":"rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium assemble six different museums: the Oldmasters Museum, Modern Museum, Meunier Museum, Wiertz Museum, Magritte Museum and the Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Museo Reale delle Belle Arti del Belgio","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"I Musei Reali delle Belle Arti del Belgio sono sei musei di Bruxelles: l'Oldmasters Museum, il Mus\u00e9e Modern, il Meunier Museum, il Wiertz Museum, il Magritte Museum ed il Fin-de-si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Les Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique sont constitu\u00e9s de six mus\u00e9es bruxellois: le Mus\u00e9e Oldmasters Museum, le Mus\u00e9e Modern Museum, le Mus\u00e9e Meunier Museum, le Mus\u00e9e Wiertz Museum, le Magritte Museum et le Mus\u00e9e fin-de-si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Museos Reales de Bellas Artes de B\u00e9lgica","address_street_name":"rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Los Museos Reales de Bellas Artes de B\u00e9lgica son seis museos situados en Bruselas: el Museo de Arte Antiguo, el Museo de Arte Moderno, el Museo Meunier, el Museo Wiertz, el Museo Magritte y el Museo de Fin de Siglo.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Koninklijke Musea voor Schone Kunsten van Belgi\u00eb","address_street_name":"Regentschapsstraat","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Regentschapsstraat, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Onder de hoede van de Koninklijke Musea voor Schone Kunsten van Belgi\u00eb staan zes afzonderlijke musea: het Mus\u00e9e Oldmasters Museum, het Mus\u00e9e Modern Museum, het Mus\u00e9e Meunier Museum, het Mus\u00e9e Wiertz Museum, het Magritte Museum en het Mus\u00e9e fin-de-si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":null,"booking_url":nu