vin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lamontagnemagique.be\/kevin\/","email":"info@montagnemagique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 210 15 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 210 15 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008217"},"pt":{"name":"Kevin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lamontagnemagique.be\/kevin\/","email":"info@montagnemagique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 210 15 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 210 15 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008217"},"en":{"name":"Kevin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lamontagnemagique.be\/kevin\/","email":"info@montagnemagique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 210 15 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 210 15 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008217"},"it":{"name":"Kevin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lamontagnemagique.be\/kevin\/","email":"info@montagnemagique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 210 15 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 210 15 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008217"},"cn":{"name":"Kevin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lamontagnemagique.be\/kevin\/","email":"info@montagnemagique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 210 15 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 210 15 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008217"},"fr":{"name":"Kevin","shortdescr":"Dans le cadre de D\u00e9clic \u2014 Le Tournant (RTBF)\n","longdescr":"Il y a les profs qui aiment leurs \u00e9l\u00e8ves, les p\u00e9dagogues comp\u00e9tents et dont la personnalit\u00e9 est une le\u00e7on \u00e0 elle seule, les directions d\u2019\u00e9cole engag\u00e9es, qui luttent chaque jour jusqu\u2019\u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9puisement, les parents impliqu\u00e9s, les \u00e9l\u00e8ves inspirants. On ne parlera pas d\u2019eux.\n\nOn parlera de K\u00e9vin.\nParce que l\u2019\u00e9cole, pour K\u00e9vin, \u00e7a n\u2019a pas du tout march\u00e9.\n\nApr\u00e8s avoir d\u00e9compos\u00e9, analys\u00e9 et d\u00e9sacralis\u00e9 l\u2019orthographe, Arnaud et J\u00e9r\u00f4me s\u2019attaquent \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9cole. Ils jettent un regard na\u00eff mais document\u00e9 sur ses fondements, ses valeurs et ses enjeux.\n\nIls pr\u00e9sentent ici la version conf\u00e9rence tir\u00e9e du spectacle KEVIN. Dans ses cr\u00e9ations, la compagnie Chantal et Bernadette aime transformer la d\u00e9marche scientifique en geste artistique en cr\u00e9ant son propre langage th\u00e9\u00e2tral. \u00c0 travers ses collaborations \u00e9troites avec des chercheurs et des chercheuses, elle tente de stimuler l\u2019esprit critique du public en soumettant ses opinions \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9preuve des faits. Quand on parle d\u2019\u00e9cole, on parle toujours du poisson qui s\u2019est \u00e9chapp\u00e9\u2026 mais jamais du filet.\n\nDe et avec Arnaud Hoedt et J\u00e9r\u00f4me Piron. D\u00e9veloppement, production et diffusion: Habemus Papam(Cora-Line Lef\u00e8vre, Rosine Louviaux et Alix Maraval).","performers":"Compagnie Chantal & Bernadette","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lamontagnemagique.be\/kevin\/","email":"info@montagnemagique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 210 15 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 210 15 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008217"},"sp":{"name":"Kevin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lamontagnemagique.be\/kevin\/","email":"info@montagnemagique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 210 15 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 210 15 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008217"},"nl":{"name":"Kevin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"b