url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006056"},"cn":{"name":"Les Dames en Noir","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be\/jardinevents\/2017\/10\/25\/brel-bruno-ke5n8-r6mk8-nks45-sbres-7lany-3zjhw-y6bjj-gx3n7-wh5xp-lf8zb-26jae-6zdj2-z2t7k-x8b8m-bmygb","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006056"},"fr":{"name":"Les Dames en Noir","shortdescr":"Une envie de vous raconter une histoire : celle de la vie, de l\u2019amour, d\u2019une rupture, de la tristesse\u2026 la vie quoi ! Mais aussi et surtout une envie d\u2019approfondir le r\u00e9pertoire connu et surtout moins connu de deux des grandes dames en noirs de la chanson fran\u00e7aise que sont Barbara et Piaf.","longdescr":"Une envie de vous raconter une histoire : celle de la vie, de l\u2019amour, d\u2019une rupture, de la tristesse, des \u00e9garements aussi puis d\u2019une nouvelle rencontre, une de celles qui compte, qui donne envie de rena\u00eetre et du coup de parler d\u2019autre chose, un peu, pour revenir tout de m\u00eame \u00e0 l\u2019amour, \u00e0 son amour\u2026la vie quoi ! Mais aussi une envie d\u2019approfondir le r\u00e9pertoire connu et surtout moins connu de deux des grandes dames en noirs de la chanson fran\u00e7aise que sont Barbara et Piaf. Les Dames en noir sont n\u00e9es de la rencontre d\u2019une actrice, chanteuse et auteure dramatique venant de l\u2019op\u00e9ra qui rencontre une accord\u00e9oniste\u2026cela donne : Les Dames en noir. \u2013 Repr\u00e9sentation \u00e0 20h45.","performers":"Anna Renouprez (voix); Cathy Pauly (accord\u00e9on)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be\/jardinevents\/2017\/10\/25\/brel-bruno-ke5n8-r6mk8-nks45-sbres-7lany-3zjhw-y6bjj-gx3n7-wh5xp-lf8zb-26jae-6zdj2-z2t7k-x8b8m-bmygb","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006056"},"sp":{"name":"Les Dames en Noir","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be\/jardinevents\/2017\/10\/25\/brel-bruno-ke5n8-r6mk8-nks45-sbres-7lany-3zjhw-y6bjj-gx3n7-wh5xp-lf8zb-26jae-6zdj2-z2t7k-x8b8m-bmygb","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006056"},"nl":{"name":"Les Dames en Noir","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be\/jardinevents\/2017\/10\/25\/brel-bruno-ke5n8-r6mk8-nks45-sbres-7lany-3zjhw-y6bjj-gx3n7-wh5xp-lf8zb-26jae-6zdj2-z2t7k-x8b8m-bmygb","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006056"}},"place":{"id":220283,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Dieses malerische Caf\u00e9-Theater, das 1994 in der N\u00e4he des alten \"Grand B\u00e9guinage de Bruxelles\" er\u00f6ffnet wurde, \u00fcberrascht durch seine \u00fcberaus kleinen R\u00e4umlichkeiten. Doch daf\u00fcr ist das Programm ist umso \"gr\u00f6\u00dfer\". Reservierung empfohlen!","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Grootgodshuisstraat","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Grootgodshuisstraat, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"The desire to present theater amongst people; as if a performance is nothing but a conversation, in a place somewhere in between the large halls and the streets, half living room, half pub, in a warm ambiance where one can sip a glass while watching a performance. That's cafe-theater \"Le Jardin de ma Soeur\", at the edge of the ancient \"Grand B\u00e9guinage de Bruxelles\", alongside one of the quays of the old port of Brussels where the spirit of the dock workers lingers and where one can still feel the presence of the beguines with their long black robes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Jardin de ma S\u0153ur est situ\u00e9 au coin d'une rue du pittoresque March\u00e9 aux poissons, \u00e0 proximit\u00e9 de l\u2019ancien Grand B\u00e9guinage de Bruxelles. On peut difficilement imaginer un nom plus familier. Pourtant, cet endroit n'a pas vol\u00e9 son nom. Vous obtenez exactement ce que vous attendez : une soir\u00e9e sans pr\u00e9tention, pleine de divertissements et de moments partag\u00e9s. Vous vous y sentez comme dans votre salon. Vous oubliez imm\u00e9diatement tous vos soucis et riez, chantez et profitez du spectacle avec les autres participants. Sp\u00e9cialement pour les amateurs de chanson fran\u00e7aise et de th\u00e9\u00e2tre.  \u202f \r\nPensez \u00e0 r\u00e9server votre place !\r\n ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street