/agenda\/event-detail.50008206"},"en":{"name":"Plume","shortdescr":"Plume is a jazz quartet that explores the art of improvisation through a repertoire of through a repertoire of original compositions.","longdescr":"They use jazz and improvisation as the key to approaching various musical styles, as a way of searching for their own musicalities and as an open door to greater freedom.They use jazz and improvisation as an approach to various musical styles, as a means of exploring their own musicalities and as a door to greater freedom.They like to emphasise the creative process in creative process in which the framework is set by the composition and improvisation allows different musical dimensions to be explored through the connection it creates between the musicians. For them, a piece of music is like a living organism; it's not possible to play the same piece twice in a row. Its mood changes from day to day, but its DNA remains the same.  In jazz, Plume has found an infinitely repeatable way of playing with the fragility of the moment.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008206"},"it":{"name":"Plume","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008206"},"cn":{"name":"Plume","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008206"},"fr":{"name":"Plume","shortdescr":"Plume est un quartet de jazz qui explore l\u2019art de l\u2019improvisation \u00e0 travers un r\u00e9pertoire de compositions originales.\n","longdescr":"Ils utilisent le jazz et l'improvisation comme cl\u00e9s d\u2019approche vers divers styles musicaux, comme voie de\nrecherche de leurs musicalit\u00e9s ainsi qu'une porte ouverte vers plus de libert\u00e9.\nDamien Brassart (saxophone soprano), Emanuel Van Mieghem (contrebasse), Joseph Nowell (piano) et Gionata Giardina (batterie) aiment insister sur le processus de cr\u00e9ation en train de se produire dans lequel le cadre est fix\u00e9 par la composition et o\u00f9 l\u2019improvisation permet d\u2019explorer diff\u00e9rentes dimensions musicales gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la connexion qu\u2019elle induit entre les musiciens. Pour eux, un morceau de musique est\ncomme un organisme vivant, ce n\u2019est pas possible de jouer le m\u00eame deux fois de suite. Son humeur change en fonction des jours mais son ADN reste le m\u00eame.\nPlume a trouv\u00e9 dans le jazz une mani\u00e8re infiniment r\u00e9it\u00e9rable de jouer avec la\n","performers":"Damien Brassart (saxophone soprano), Emanuel Van Mieghem (contrebasse), Joseph\n\nNowell (piano) et Gionata Giardina (batterie)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008206"},"sp":{"name":"Plume","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008206"},"nl":{"name":"Plume","shortdescr":"Plume is een jazzkwartet dat de kunst van improvisatie verkent door middel van een repertoire van door middel van een repertoire van originele composities.\n\n","longdescr":"Ze gebruiken jazz en improvisatie als benadering van verschillende muziekstijlen, als een manier om hun eigen muzikaliteit te verkennen en als een deur naar meer vrijheid.\n\nZe leggen graag de nadruk op het creatieve proces in een creatief proces waarin het kader wordt bepaald door de compositie en improvisatie verschillende muzikale dimensies laat verkennen door de verbinding die het cre\u00ebert tussen de muzikanten. Voor hen is een muziekstuk als een levend organisme; het is niet mogelijk om hetzelfde stuk twee keer achter elkaar te spelen. De stemming verandert van dag tot dag, maar het DNA blijft hetzelfde.\nIn jazz heeft Plume een oneindig herhaalbare manier gevonden om te spelen met de kwetsbaarheid van het moment.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":"+32 475 36 18 36","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008206"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_st