lieux * 28 spectacles * 63 repr\u00e9sentations. \n","longdescr":"UP FESTIVAL\nLe futur s\u2019\u00e9crit en Cirque !\n\nIls & elles osent tout : d\u00e9fier l\u2019impossible, sublimer le quotidien, explorer nos vertiges int\u00e9rieurs. Irr\u00e9sistibles & g\u00e9n\u00e9reux\u00b7ses, les artistes de UP FESTIVAL mettent l\u2019imagination au pouvoir \u2013 et elle n\u2019a pas de limite ! En 12 jours, 28 spectacles & 63 repr\u00e9sentations, UP FESTIVAL r\u00e9unit \u00e0 Bruxelles le meilleur du Cirque contemporain, celui qui tutoie les \u00e9toiles & nous interroge sur notre avenir collectif. Un rendez-vous incontournable, toutes g\u00e9n\u00e9rations confondues, pour r\u00eaver ensemble \u00e0 de nouveaux \u00e9quilibres\u2026\n \nUP FESTIVAL prendra place cette ann\u00e9e, \u00e0 UP, bien s\u00fbr, sous Chapiteau, en Salle, In Situ, en Appartements & en Espace Public, ainsi qu'au BRONKS, au Centre culturel d\u2019Uccle, au Jacques Franck, aux Halles de Schaerbeek, \u00e0 la Maison des Cultures | MCCS, au Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Marni, au Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Varia & \u00e0 Wolubilis.\n\nA l\u2019AFFICHE : Magda Clan, EMISFERO \u2022 B\u00eates de Foire, DECROCHEZ-MOI-CA \u2022 Th\u00e9\u00e2tre d\u20191 Jour, RECLAIM \u2022 Side Show, PERMIT OH PERMIT MY SOUL TO REBEL \u2022 Les Filles du Renard P\u00e2le, REVOLTE, OU TENTATIVES DE L\u2019ECHEC \u2022 Akira Yoshida, ENSEMBLE POUR Y ARRIVER [Together To Get There] \u2022 Be Flat, LIVING \u2022 Los Putos Makinas | LPM, PETROLEO \u2022 Sawdust Symphony \u2022 Compagnie ar, FORA \u2022 La Croustade, L'APRES-MIDI TOMBE QUAND TES BISCUITS SE RUINENT \u2022 Liam Lelarge & Kim Marro, LA BOULE \u2022 Cia Basti \/ Bastian Von Marttens, CONVERSATIONS AVEC LA MORT \u2022 Cie Hopscotch, #CLICKIT \u2022 Cie Rauxa, UNE HISTOIRE DE LAINE \u2022 Cie Barks, MIR \u2022 Menteuses Cie, PLONGER \u2022 Palimesta, MASHA \u2022 Smart Cie, UBA \u2022 Baccala Clown, PSS PSS \u2022 Natalie Reckert & Mark Morreau, NATALIE NSIDE OUT \u2022 Mathieu Despoisse & Etienne Manceau, PLING KLANG \u2022 ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/upupup.be","email":"info@upupup.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 538 12 02","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005590"},"sp":{"name":"UP Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/upupup.be","email":"info@upupup.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 538 12 02","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005590"},"nl":{"name":"UP Festival 18e editie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/upupup.be","email":"info@upupup.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 538 12 02","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005590"}},"place":{"id":226740,"translations":{"de":{"name":"UP - Circus & Performing Arts","address_street_name":"Rue Osseghem","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"communication@catastrophe.be","website":"http:\/\/upupup.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 12 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Osseghem, 50","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"UP - Circus & Performing Arts","address_street_name":"Rue Osseghem","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"communication@catastrophe.be","website":"http:\/\/upupup.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 12 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Osseghem, 50","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"UP - Circus & Performing Arts","address_street_name":"Rue Osseghem","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"communication@catastrophe.be","website":"http:\/\/upupup.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 12 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Osseghem, 50","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"A change of scenery for the Espace Catastrophe performance venue, which changed its premises from the Glaci\u00e8res at Saint Gilles to Molenbeek. With a name that makes you want to get up and move your body, UP Circus & Performing Arts has taken over a huge site, with incredible outdoor spaces, including a giant marquee and equally impressive indoor facilities. Physical training rooms, a documentation centre, a small catering area and even a second-hand store disguised as a \"costume library\", there are 6,000m\u00b2 of space open to all possibilities that give a real boost to this contemporary circus.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"UP - Circus & Performing Arts","address_street_name":"Rue Osseghem","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"communication@catastrophe.be","website":"http:\/\/upupup.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 12 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Osseghem, 50","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"UP - Circus & Performing Arts","address_street_name":"Rue Osseghem","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"communication@catastrophe.be","website":"http:\/\/upupup.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 12 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Osseghem, 50","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"UP - Circus & Performing Arts","address_street_name":"Rue Osseghem","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"communication@catastrophe.be","website":"http:\/\/upupup.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 12 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Osseghem, 50","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Changement de d\u00e9cor pour l\u2019espace Catastrophe qui a fait voyager ses locaux des Glaci\u00e8res de Saint Gilles jusqu\u2019\u00e0 Molenbeek. Avec un nom qui donne envie de se lever et de bouger son corps, UP Circus & Performing Arts a investi un site \u00e9norme avec des espaces ext\u00e9rieurs incroyables dont un chapiteau g\u00e9ant et des am\u00e9nagements int\u00e9rieurs tout aussi impressionnants. Salles d\u2019entra\u00eenement physique, centre de documentation, petit espace de restauration et m\u00eame une friperie d\u00e9guis\u00e9e en \u00ab costumoth\u00e8que \u00bb, ce sont 6000 m\u00b2 d\u2019espaces ouverts \u00e0 tous les possibles qui donnent un vrai coup de boost au cirque contemporain.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"UP - Circus & Performing Arts","address_street_name":"Rue Osseghem","address_street_number":"50","address_street_box":null,"email":"communication@catastrophe.be","website":"http:\/\/upupup.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 12 02","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Osseghem, 50","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"UP - Circus & Performing Arts","address_stree