ploration of traditional know-how, reused materials and vernacular practices.","longdescr":"The exhibition is open free of charge and without reservation on Fridays from 1.30pm to 6pm, during Gilbard's opening hours. The rest of the week by appointment.\nWould you like to organize a guided tour with a group?\nContact us at prog@gilbard.be\nFinissage on Friday 05\/04\/2024 and Saturday 06\/04\/24, from 13h30 to 18h, in the presence of the artist.\nWith the support of R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles Capitale, FWB design & mode, FWB arts plastiques, COCOF.","performers":"Emma Cogn\u00e9 (artist)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/gilbard.be\/#\/","email":"prog@gilbard.be","phone_contact":"+32 471 92 61 04","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008059"},"it":{"name":"'Pi\u00e8ges \u00e0 soleil' - Emma Cogn\u00e9 @Liverpool 77 - Gilbard","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/gilbard.be\/#\/","email":"prog@gilbard.be","phone_contact":"+32 471 92 61 04","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008059"},"cn":{"name":"'Pi\u00e8ges \u00e0 soleil' - Emma Cogn\u00e9 @Liverpool 77 - Gilbard","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/gilbard.be\/#\/","email":"prog@gilbard.be","phone_contact":"+32 471 92 61 04","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008059"},"fr":{"name":"'Pi\u00e8ges \u00e0 soleil' - Emma Cogn\u00e9 @Liverpool 77 - Gilbard","shortdescr":"Du 1er mars au 5 avril 2024, Gilbard accueille Emma Cogn\u00e9 dans le SAS pour \u201cPi\u00e8ges \u00e0 soleil\u201d.\nArtiste et designer textile, elle propose une nouvelle s\u00e9rie de sculptures de jeux issue de son projet de recherche \u201cSyst\u00e8me T\u201d, bas\u00e9 sur l\u2019exploration de savoirs-faire traditionnels, de mat\u00e9riaux de r\u00e9emploi et de pratiques vernaculaires.","longdescr":"L\u2019exposition est accessible gratuitement et sans r\u00e9servation les vendredis de 13h30 \u00e0 18h, pendant les horaires de permanence de Gilbard. \u00c9galement accessible sur rendez-vous le reste de la semaine.\nVous voulez organiser une visite guid\u00e9e avec un groupe ?\n\u00c9crivez-nous sur prog@gilbard.be\nFinissage le vendredi 05\/04\/2024 et samedi 06\/04\/24, de 13h30 \u00e0 18h, en pr\u00e9sence de l'artiste.\nAvec le soutien de R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles Capitale, FWB design & mode, FWB arts plastiques, COCOF.","performers":"Emma Cogn\u00e9 (artiste)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/gilbard.be\/#\/","email":"prog@gilbard.be","phone_contact":"+32 471 92 61 04","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008059"},"sp":{"name":"'Pi\u00e8ges \u00e0 soleil' - Emma Cogn\u00e9 @Liverpool 77 - Gilbard","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/gilbard.be\/#\/","email":"prog@gilbard.be","phone_contact":"+32 471 92 61 04","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008059"},"nl":{"name":"'Pi\u00e8ges \u00e0 soleil' - Emma Cogn\u00e9 @Liverpool 77 - Gilbard","shortdescr":"Van 1 maart tot 5 april 2024 verwelkomt Gilbard Emma Cogn\u00e9 in de SAS voor \"Pi\u00e8ges \u00e0 soleil\".\nDe kunstenares en textielontwerpster presenteert een nieuwe reeks speelsculpturen uit haar onderzoeksproject \"Syst\u00e8me T\", gebaseerd op de verkenning van traditionele knowhow, hergebruikte materialen en lokale gebruiken.","longdescr":"De tentoonstelling is gratis en zonder reservering te bezoeken op vrijdag van 13.30 tot 18.00 uur, tijdens de kantooruren van Gilbard. De rest van de week is de tentoonstelling op afspraak geopend.\nWil je een rondleiding organiseren voor een groep?\nNeem dan contact met ons op via prog@gilbard.be\nFinissage op vrijdag 05\/04\/2024 en zaterdag 06\/04\/24, van 13u30 tot 18u, in aanwezigheid van de kunstenaar.\nMet de steun van het Brussels Hoofdstedelijk Gewest, FWB design & mode, FWB arts plastiques, COCOF.","performers":"Emma Cogn\u00e9 (kunstenaar)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/gilbard.be\/#\/","email":"prog@gilbard.be","phone_contact":"+32 471 92 61 04","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008059"}},"place":{"id":50001053,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Gilbard","address_street_name":"Rue de Liverpool","address_street_number":"77","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@gilbard.be","website":"http:\/\/Gilbard.be","phone_contact":"+32 471 92 61 04","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Liverpool, 77","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Gilbard","address_street_name":"Rue de Liverpool","address_street_number":"77","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@gilbard.be","website":"http:\/\/Gilbard.be","phone_contact":"+32 471 92 61 04","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Rue de Liverpool, 77","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Gilbard","address_street_name":"Liverpoolstraat","address_street_number":"77","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@gilbard.be","website":"http:\/\/Gilbard.be","phone_contact":"+32 471 92 61 04","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Liverpoolstraat, 77","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Gilbard","address_street_name":"Rue de Liver