rles Rogier","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Belfius Art Gallery","address_street_name":"Place Charles Rogier","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"artcollection@belfius.be","website":"http:\/\/www.belfius-art-collection.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Place Charles Rogier","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Belfius Art Gallery","address_street_name":"Place Charles Rogier","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"artcollection@belfius.be","website":"http:\/\/www.belfius-art-collection.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Place Charles Rogier","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"La collection Belfius est la plus grande collection d\u2019art belge du pays. La collection compte plus de 4 300 \u0153uvres d\u2019art et r\u00e9sulte de la fusion des collections du Cr\u00e9dit communal de Belgique, de Paribas Banque Belgique et de BACOB Banque.\r\n\r\nApr\u00e8s la Deuxi\u00e8me Guerre Mondiale, tant le Cr\u00e9dit communal que Paribas Belgique ont commenc\u00e9 \u00e0 acqu\u00e9rir des \u0153uvres de grande valeur li\u00e9es \u00e0 l\u2019h\u00e9ritage national belge, afin d\u2019\u00e9viter qu\u2019elles ne disparaissent \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9tranger. D\u00e8s le d\u00e9but, le Cr\u00e9dit communal a mis l\u2019accent sur l\u2019art belge \u00e0 partir de 1860, tandis que Paribas se concentrait principalement sur des \u0153uvres du 16e au 18e si\u00e8cle et sur l\u2019art contemporain. BACOB banque a commenc\u00e9 sa collection en 1980 et s\u2019est exclusivement consacr\u00e9e \u00e0 l\u2019art contemporain belge. Aujourd\u2019hui, la collection couvre pr\u00e8s de cinq si\u00e8cles.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Belfius Art Gallery","address_street_name":"Place Charles Rogier","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"artcollection@belfius.be","website":"http:\/\/www.belfius-art-collection.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Place Charles Rogier","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Belfius Art Gallery","address_street_name":"Charles Rogierplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"artcollection@belfius.be","website":"http:\/\/www.belfius-art-collection.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","address_line1":"Charles Rogierplein","address_line2":"1210 Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","description_web":"De Belfius-kunstcollectie is de grootste verzameling van Belgische kunst van het land en omvat meer dan 4300 werken, het gevolg van de samensmelting van de kunstverzamelingen van het Gemeentekrediet, Paribas Bank Belgi\u00eb en BACOB Bank.\r\n\r\nZowel het Gemeentekrediet als Paribas Belgi\u00eb begonnen na de Tweede Wereldoorlog met het verzamelen van waardevolle kunstwerken uit het nationaal erfgoed om te vermijden dat ze naar het buitenland verdwenen. Het Gemeentekrediet legde van in het begin het accent op Belgische kunst vanaf 1860, terwijl Paribas Belgi\u00eb kunst uit de 16de tot de 18de eeuw en moderne kunst kocht. BACOB bank begon zijn verzameling in 1980 en legde zich uitsluitend toe op Belgische hedendaagse kunst. Vandaag bestrijkt de collectie werken uit bijna vijf eeuwen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[15],"translations":{"de":["Rogier"],"pt":[null],"en":["Rogier"],"it":["Rogier"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Rogier"],"sp":["Rogier"],"nl":["Rogier"]}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"de":["Norden"],"pt":[null],"en":["North"],"it":["Nord"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"nl":["Noord"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":26601,"location":{"lat":50.85559436,"lon":4.35809247},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-11-16T13:01:22+01:00","published_at":"2016-10-14T09:55:01+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":1487,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"http:\/\/www.arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"http:\/\/www.arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"http:\/\/www.arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"As specialists in architectural heritage and contemporary art, we make the public (re)discover the city through guided tours and conferences in several languages. \r\n\r\nOur activities :\r\nGuided tours by foot, bus and metro - Educational projects - Exceptional interior visit- Team Building \r\n\r\nArkadia offers a wide selection of guided tours, under different forms: \r\n* For individual, we propose an annual programmation (almost only in French), which will make you take a new and attentive look on the city of Brussels. \r\n* For groups we offer a series of fun and original activities, around history, architecture, art and in exceptional interiors. \r\n* For schools and children, we offer thematic, educational and entertaining tours and stages. \r\n\r\nOur expertise : Our team is made up of 60 guides, historians and art historians. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"http:\/\/www.arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"http:\/\/www.arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name"