u00e0 19:00"],"nl":["maandag, dinsdag, woensdag, donderdag en vrijdag: gesloten","zaterdag en zondag: van 17:00 tot 19:00"]},"date_start":"2023-09-02","date_end":"2024-06-30","is_also_by_appointment":false}],"date_exceptions":[],"closing_days":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"accessibilities":[],"recurring":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[]},{"id":518572,"date_start":"2023-12-01","date_end":"2024-07-07","date_next":"2024-03-23","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-03-10T01:04:45+01:00","published_at":"2021-09-07T17:12:07+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":true,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":238572,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"tour","ranking":0.165650381235981,"languages":{"spoken":["en","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"de":"Stadtf\u00fchrungen","pt":null,"en":"Guided tours","it":"Visite guidate","cn":null,"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","sp":"Visitas guiadas","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen"}},"others":{"list":[112],"translations":{"de":["Ausgefallenes"],"pt":[null],"en":["Unusual"],"it":["Insolito"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Insolite"],"sp":["Ins\u00f3lito"],"nl":["Ongewoon"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"DISCOVER & TASTE Coffee Tour - Downtown Kanaal, Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.okcoffee.tips","email":"thomas@okcoffee.tips","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.518572"},"pt":{"name":"DISCOVER & TASTE Coffee Tour - Downtown Kanaal, Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.okcoffee.tips","email":"thomas@okcoffee.tips","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.518572"},"en":{"name":"Discovery Coffee Tours","shortdescr":"A memorable tour of Brussels focusing on quality coffee? Introducing Brussels Coffee Tours! Explore different districts in an original way with our unusual tours dedicated to speciality coffee. These coffee tours are an invitation to immerse yourself in the captivating world of speciality coffee in the heart of Europe's capital.","longdescr":"BRUSSELS COFFEE TOUR\n\nDuring the Coffee Tours, you will experience iconic ways of making and drinking coffee in surprising locations.\n\nShort, long, filter, milky, cold, fancy, traditional or sometimes experimental coffee... be prepared!\n\n- 6 innovative places (sometimes a little more or a little less depending on the neighborhood)\n- 4 hours of tips and fun provided by pros\n- 1 unique neighborhood experience around the different methods of coffee preparation\n\nAt the end of the Coffee Tour, you'll know a little more about\n- Specialty coffee, its terroirs and its values\n- how to taste and appreciate a good coffee\n- where to drink in your favorite neighborhood\n- tasty preparation methods\n- how to improve your coffee at home\n\nWho is it for?\nThe Coffee Tours are aimed at coffee lovers, but also at horeca professionals and tea lovers (surprise guaranteed)!\n\nThe Coffee Tours last on average 4 hours, are totally outdoor (dress accordingly!!) and do not end at the starting point. \n\nMore practical information when you make your reservation.\n\nDiscover, taste, enjoy... repeat!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.okcoffee.tips","email":"thomas@okcoffee.tips","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.518572"},"it":{"name":"DISCOVER & TASTE Coffee Tour - Downtown Kanaal, Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.okcoffee.tips","email":"thomas@okcoffee.tips","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.518572"},"cn":{"name":"DISCOVER & TASTE Coffee Tour - Downtown Kanaal, Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.okcoffee.tips","email":"thomas@okcoffee.tips","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.518572"},"fr":{"name":"Brussels Coffee Tours","shortdescr":"Une visite insolite \u00e0 Bruxelles ax\u00e9e sur le caf\u00e9 de qualit\u00e9? Voici les Brussels Coffee Tours ! Explorez diff\u00e9rents quartiers d'une mani\u00e8re originale avec nos visites insolites d\u00e9di\u00e9es au caf\u00e9 de sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9. Ces coffee tours sont une invitation \u00e0 plonger dans l'univers captivant du caf\u00e9 de sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de la capitale de l'Europe.","longdescr":"BRUSSELS COFFEE TOURS\n\nLors des Brussels Coffee Tours, vous go\u00fbterez diff\u00e9rentes m\u00e9thodes de pr\u00e9paration embl\u00e9matiques dans des lieux surprenants. \n\nCaf\u00e9 serr\u00e9, allong\u00e9, filtre, lact\u00e9, froid, signature, traditionnel ou parfois exp\u00e9rimental\u2026 soyez pr\u00eat.e !\n\n    - 6 d\u00e9gustations dans des lieux uniques (parfois un peu plus ou un peu moins)\n    - 4h de conseils et de fun donn\u00e9s par des professionnel.les du milieu\n    - 1 viste insolite et unique autour de votre boisson pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e\n\n\u00c0 la fin du Brussels Coffee Tour, vous en saurez un peu plus sur\n\n    - les bons spots de votre quartier pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9\n    - le caf\u00e9 de sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9, ses terroirs et ses valeurs\n    - comment go\u00fbter et appr\u00e9cier un bon caf\u00e9\n    - diff\u00e9rentes m\u00e9thodes de pr\u00e9paration\n    - comment am\u00e9liorer votre caf\u00e9 chez vous\n\nPour qui ?\nLes Coffee Tours s\u2019adressent aux amateur.ices de caf\u00e9, mais aussi aux professionnel.les de l\u2019horeca et aux amateur.ices de th\u00e9 (surprise garantie) !\n\nLes Coffee Tours durent en moyenne 4h, se passent totalement en ext\u00e9rieur (bien s\u2019habiller en cons\u00e9quence!!) et ne se terminent pas au point de d\u00e9part. \n\nPlus d\u2019infos pratiques lors de la r\u00e9servation.\n\nD\u00e9couvrez, go\u00fbtez, appr\u00e9ciez\u2026 recommencez !","performers":"Thomas Wyngaard est fondateur de OK Coffee. \nIl est consultant ind\u00e9pendant, enseignant (certifi\u00e9 par la Specialty Coffee Association de janvier 2018 \u00e0 avril 2021), tour-ist et broadcaster. Apr\u00e8s avoir \u00e9t\u00e9 form\u00e9 en France, en Pologne et en Estonie, il fait ses armes chez les meilleurs en Belgique, avec \u00e9galement un \u00e9pisode de presque 2 ans \u00e0 New York o\u00f9 il a offici\u00e9 comme conseiller et formateur. ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.okcoffee.tips","email":"thomas@okcoffee.tips","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.518572"},"sp":{"name":"DISCOVER & TASTE Coffee Tour - Downtown Kanaal, Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.okcoffee.tips","email":"thomas@okcoffee.tips","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.518572"},"nl":{"name":"Discovery Coffee Tours","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.okcoffee.tips","email":"thomas@okcoffee.tips","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/even