blication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":true,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":296694,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"tour","ranking":1,"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"de":"Stadtf\u00fchrungen","pt":null,"en":"Guided tours","it":"Visite guidate","cn":null,"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","sp":"Visitas guiadas","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen"}},"others":{"list":[116],"translations":{"de":["Br\u00fcssel vom Wasser aus"],"pt":[null],"en":["Brussels on water"],"it":["Bruxelles sull\u2019acqua"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Bruxelles sur l\u2019eau"],"sp":["Bruselas sobre el agua"],"nl":["Brussel op het water"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Dimanche \u00e0 v\u00e9lo : vers les sources de la Woluwe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/news","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008512"},"pt":{"name":"Dimanche \u00e0 v\u00e9lo : vers les sources de la Woluwe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/news","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008512"},"en":{"name":"Dimanche \u00e0 v\u00e9lo : vers les sources de la Woluwe","shortdescr":"In the context of World Water Day (March 22nd), our first Bike Sunday of 2024 will be dedicated to the theme of water. On this tour, we'll be cycling from Brussels city centre to the \u00c9tangs des Enfants Noy\u00e9s in Watermael-Boitsfort, heading towards the sources of the Woluwe stream. En route, we'll explore other water sites in Brussels.","longdescr":"Enjoy the city as it slowly wakes up on a Sunday morning. A pleasant bike ride through the greenery, a good dose of exercise and a good time to meet other Brussels cyclists!  Each month, we choose a green gem in Brussels to discover by bike. One of our guides maps out a pleasant route and, just before midday, we arrive at our destination. We bring something to drink, but feel free to bring your own snack!\n\nIn the context of World Water Day (March 22nd), our first Bike Sunday of 2024 will be dedicated to the theme of water. On this tour, we'll be cycling from Brussels city centre to the \u00c9tangs des Enfants Noy\u00e9s in Watermael-Boitsfort, heading towards the sources of the Woluwe stream. En route, we'll explore other water sites in Brussels.","performers":"You will be accompanied by one of our guides to your destination. You can then return to the centre of Brussels with our guide, or decide to enjoy the place for longer!","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/news","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008512"},"it":{"name":"Dimanche \u00e0 v\u00e9lo : vers les sources de la Woluwe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/news","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008512"},"cn":{"name":"Dimanche \u00e0 v\u00e9lo : vers les sources de la Woluwe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/news","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008512"},"fr":{"name":"Dimanche \u00e0 v\u00e9lo : vers les sources de la Woluwe","shortdescr":"Dans le contexte de la Journ\u00e9e mondiale de l\u2019eau (le 22 mars), notre premier Dimanche \u00e0 v\u00e9lo de l\u2019ann\u00e9e 2024 sera d\u00e9di\u00e9 au th\u00e8me de l\u2019eau. Lors de ce tour, nous partirons vers les sources du ruisseau de la Woluwe en p\u00e9dalant de Bruxelles-ville vers les \u00c9tangs des Enfants Noy\u00e9s \u00e0 Watermael-Boitsfort. En route, nous explorerons d\u2019autres lieux d'eau \u00e0 Bruxelles.","longdescr":"Profitez de la ville qui se r\u00e9veille lentement \u00e0 v\u00e9lo le dimanche matin. Une agr\u00e9able promenade \u00e0 v\u00e9lo dans la verdure, une bonne dose d'exercice et un bon moment pour rencontrer d'autres Bruxellois \u00e0 v\u00e9lo !  Chaque mois, nous choisissons une perle verte de Bruxelles \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir \u00e0 v\u00e9lo. L'un de nos guides trace un itin\u00e9raire agr\u00e9able et, un peu avant midi, nous arrivons \u00e0 destination. Nous apportons quelque chose \u00e0 boire, mais n'h\u00e9sitez pas \u00e0 apporter votre propre casse-cro\u00fbte !\n\nDans le contexte de la Journ\u00e9e mondiale de l\u2019eau (le 22 mars), notre premier Dimanche \u00e0 v\u00e9lo de l\u2019ann\u00e9e 2024 sera d\u00e9di\u00e9 au th\u00e8me de l\u2019eau. Lors de ce tour, nous partirons vers les sources du ruisseau de la Woluwe en p\u00e9dalant de Bruxelles-ville vers les \u00c9tangs des Enfants Noy\u00e9s \u00e0 Watermael-Boitsfort. En route, nous explorerons d\u2019autres lieux d'eau \u00e0 Bruxelles.","performers":"Vous serez accompagn\u00e9.e.s par un de nos guides jusqu'\u00e0 destination. Vous pouvez ensuite revenir vers le centre de Bruxelles avec notre guide, ou d\u00e9cider de profiter du lieu plus longtemps!","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/news","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008512"},"sp":{"name":"Dimanche \u00e0 v\u00e9lo : vers les sources de la Woluwe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/news","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008512"},"nl":{"name":"Dimanche \u00e0 v\u00e9lo : vers les sources de la Woluwe","shortdescr":"In het kader van Wereldwaterdag (22 maart) staat onze eerste Brusseleirs tour van 2024 in het teken van water. Tijdens deze tour gaan we naar de bronnen van de Woluwe fietsend vanuit Brussel-Stad richting Vijvers van de Verdronken Kinderen in Watermaal-Bosvoorde. Onderweg verkennen we nog andere waterplekken in Brussel.","longdescr":" Geniet van de langzaam ontwakende stad op de fiets op zondagochtend. Een aangename fietstocht in het groen, een gezonde dosis beweging en een mooi moment om andere Brusselaars te ontmoeten op de fiets!  Elke maand kiezen we een groene parel in Brussel uit om te ontdekken met de fiets. Een van onze gidsen stippelt een mooie fietsroute en iets voor de middag komen we aan op onze bestemming. Wij zorgen voor iets te drinken, neem gerust zelf een hapje mee!\n\nIn het kader van Wereldwaterdag (22 maart) staat onze eerste Brusseleirs tour van 2024 in het teken van water. Tijdens deze tour gaan we naar de bronnen van de Woluwe fietsend vanuit Brussel-Stad richting Vijvers van de Verdronken Kinderen in Watermaal-Bosvoorde. Onderweg verkennen we nog andere waterplekken in Brussel.","performers":"Je wordt begeleid door een van onze gidsen naar je bestemming. Je kunt dan met onze gids terugkeren naar het centrum van Brussel, of besluiten om langer van de plek te genieten!","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cactus.brussels\/news","email":"info@cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50008512"}},"place":{"id":277608,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo is an association of local volunteer guides with a passion for Brussels and cycling. They enthusiastically share their passion for the city and cycling with visitors to Brussels and other Brussels residents. On their bikes they find the right pace to immerse you in the city and offer an authentic Brussels experience. Above all, they prefer to guide you off the beaten track in a friendly atmosphere. Experience Brussels in all its splendour by bike and discover more than you think.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 497 19 07 14","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo est une association de guides b\u00e9n\u00e9voles locaux ayant \u00e0 c\u0153ur Bruxelles et le v\u00e9lo. Ils partagent avec enthousiasme leur passion pour la ville et le v\u00e9lo avec des visiteurs de Bruxelles et d\u2019autres Bruxellois. A v\u00e9lo ils trouvent le rythme id\u00e9al pour vous immerger dans la ville et ils offrent une exp\u00e9rience authentique 